invariant: INV-16
file: Makefile
catches: test/lint-trust-separation.sh
reason: every object carries x25519_wide.c, a device object among them. The
  file compiles to nothing there, so nothing fails, and a later change
  that calls its entries would run the 64x64->128 multiply where no
  session states its timing. lint-trust-separation's X25519 rows ban the
  file from every device object's source list.

--- old
ifneq ($(CPU_RUNTIME_DEF),)
LIB_SRCS += x25519_wide.c
endif
--- new
LIB_SRCS += x25519_wide.c
